    "summary": "A rule triggered ‘against’ an attack triggers once the attacking unit has finished the [Select Targets](vsdata:core-rule/select-targets) step, if its other requirements are met, such as the attacker’s or its weapons’ characteristics.\n\nA rule that triggers on an attack being ‘allocated’ to a unit does so in step 1 of [Inflict Damage](vsdata:core-rule/inflict-damage).",
